      "kind": "family",
      "text": "The black hole of the same gravity, on the same strip of anti-de Sitter space. With its two boundaries uncoupled, the dilaton vanishes in the future and the past of the strip, and no light ray passes from one boundary to the other [maldacena2018]."
    },
    {
      "id": "anti_de_sitter",
